## Data (Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0)

The LSJ lexicon data (`data/lsj_unicode/`) and derived morphology databases are licensed under:

**Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International**
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

**Attribution:** Liddell–Scott–Jones Greek-English Lexicon — **Perseus Tufts and Helma Dik/Logeion**.

The LSJ text used here is [LSJLogeion](https://github.com/helmadik/LSJLogeion), the heavily
edited Chicago/Logeion version of the Perseus LSJ: all Greek converted to Unicode, many
entries split or merged, and continuous corrections against the print text and the
Supplements. That project asks specifically that users "credit Perseus Tufts *and* Helma
Dik/Logeion" — please carry both names through into any redistribution.

**You are free to:**
